item.description:
Select each changed Java file in the LTK preview and inspect its
combined diff. Confirm that:



• a factory appears only for an obviously equivalent bundle identity;

• delegated or dynamic identities remain in a constructor;

• message and throwable are preserved;

• nonzero application-specific codes are not proposed;

• the resulting expression has the required IStatus or Status type.



Deselect an entire file when its complete proposed change should not
be applied.

After applying the cleanup:



1. compile the affected plug-in projects;

2. run logging and error-handling tests;

3. inspect consumers of getPlugin() and getCode();

4. use Eclipse Undo to restore the complete cleanup operation when
   validation fails.
